{{~##
Page Body Template

Renders a simple content page without image gallery.
Used for text-only pages like About, Contact, etc.

Expects:
- gallery: { title, body }
- basepath: Relative path to root

Heading: the title is the page's single <h1>, unless the Markdown body brings its own.
##~}}
{{~ body_has_h1 = gallery.body && (gallery.body | string.contains '<h1') ~}}
{{~ # Page Content (rendered from _index.revela body using Markdig) ~}}
<section>
    {{~ if !body_has_h1 ~}}
    <h1>{{ html_escape ((gallery.title && gallery.title != '') ? gallery.title : site.title) }}</h1>
    {{~ end ~}}
    {{~ gallery.body ~}}
</section>
